B.atW=new A.a9j(null)
B.Y0=new A.ao(57825,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.atY=new A.G6(B.Y0,"Get Directions","Navigate to the nearest mosque with turn-by-turn directions.",null)
B.atZ=new A.G6(B.vZ,"Prayer Times","Check with your local mosque for accurate prayer times and congregation.",null)
B.au_=new A.G6(B.wb,"Find Mosques","Discover mosques near your current location using Google Maps.",null)
B.aD=new A.Al(0,"minWidth")
B.af=new A.Al(1,"maxWidth")
B.aL=new A.Al(2,"minHeight")
B.aF=new A.Al(3,"maxHeight")
B.a0U=A.a(s(["Daily Islam is a free Islamic app and website for prayer times, the Quran, hadith, nasheeds, books, and daily learning. This policy explains what information the phone apps and this website use, and what stays on your device.","The publisher is Muhammad Khurram Jamil. You can write to khurram.jamilsatti@gmail.com. The same policy is published at khurram-jamil.gitlab.io/my-profile/daily-islam/privacy/."]),t.s)
B.adI=new A.af("Who this policy is for",B.a0U)
B.a25=A.a(s(["The website and the Android and iOS apps share the same reading content. They do not work the same way with your device. The phone apps can ask for location, show ads, use the camera for a barcode, and use the flashlight. This website shows one Google AdSense ad in the home page and one Google AdSense ad at the top of a detail page. The ads sit in the page, so you can keep reading. No other ads are loaded. Sexual content, nudity, and betting are not wanted on this site. It does not ask you to sign in.","Opening a page on the website sends the usual technical details that come with any visit, such as your IP address, the browser you use, and the page you requested. Daily Islam does not run its own account system on the website."]),t.s)
B.adE=new A.af("The website and the phone apps",B.a25)
B.a2c=A.a(s(["The phone app asks for your location so it can calculate prayer times, show the qibla direction, and help you find nearby mosques. Prayer times are calculated on the device from that location and from the calculation method you choose.","Daily Islam does not upload a location history to its own server. If you open a mosque in Google Maps, that place is sent to Google as part of the maps link. You can refuse location permission. Prayer times then stay on the last place the app already has, or they wait until a location is available."]),t.s)
B.acK=new A.af("Location",B.a2c)
B.a3n=A.a(s(["The Android and iOS apps are supported by ads. They show banner and full-screen ads through Google AdMob, the Google Mobile Ads SDK. AdMob uses the advertising ID, device details, IP address, and ad interactions to show and measure ads.","On Android 13 and later the app declares the advertising-ID permission so that identifier is available. Daily Islam does not receive the advertising ID on its own server and does not sell personal information.","You can reset or delete the advertising ID, or turn off ad personalization, in your phone settings under Google, then Ads, or at adssettings.google.com. Google\u2019s own policy is at policies.google.com/privacy. The website shows only Google AdSense: one ad in the home page and one ad at the top of a detail page. It does not load the phone AdMob ads or any other ad network."]),t.s)
B.acv=new A.af("Advertising on the phone apps",B.a3n)
B.a2M=A.a(s(["To show Quran text, translation, recitation, tafseer, hadith, and the Hijri calendar, the app and the website request that content from outside services. Those services include Al Quran Cloud, Quran.com, Aladhan, and a public hadith collection delivered through jsDelivr.","A request like that carries the usual technical information, including your IP address. Daily Islam does not add your name or an account ID to those requests, because there is no account."]),t.s)
B.acL=new A.af("Reading content from the internet",B.a2M)
B.a2l=A.a(s(["Nasheed audio is streamed. The files are not stored inside the app as a private copy of the catalog. When a track plays, the request goes to the host that serves that file, and that host sees the usual connection details such as an IP address.","The catalog itself, including titles and which tracks are offered, is part of the app. Choosing Urdu or Arabic, or searching a title, happens on your device."]),t.s)
B.adl=new A.af("Nasheeds",B.a2l)
B.a3N=A.a(s(["Scan Halal lets you type a barcode or, on a phone, scan one. The barcode is sent to Open Food Facts so the app can read the product name and ingredients and then check them on your device.","Open Food Facts receives the barcode and the usual connection details. Daily Islam does not attach your name to that lookup. The camera, when it is used, stays on the phone for the scan."]),t.s)
B.acC=new A.af("Halal product lookup",B.a3N)
B.a2k=A.a(s(["Favorites, notes, the last place you read, learning progress, prayer settings, the calculation method, and similar preferences are saved on your phone. They are not uploaded to a Daily Islam server.","Clearing the app\u2019s storage, or deleting the app, removes those saved items from the phone. The website does not keep a copy of your notes or favorites on a server either."]),t.s)
B.adJ=new A.af("What stays on your device",B.a2k)
B.a4T=A.a(s(["Daily Islam does not sell your personal information. It does not ask you to create an account, and it does not ask for a payment card. There is no Daily Islam login.","The app does not read your contacts, photos, or messages in order to build a profile. Permissions it does ask for, such as location, notifications, or the camera, are used for the feature in front of you."]),t.s)
B.acH=new A.af("What Daily Islam does not do",B.a4T)
B.a2s=A.a(s(["Daily Islam is a general-audience app and is supported by ads on the phone. It is not directed at children under 13, and it does not knowingly collect personal information from children.","If you believe a child has sent personal information to the contact address, write to khurram.jamilsatti@gmail.com and ask for that message to be deleted."]),t.s)
B.adw=new A.af("Children",B.a2s)
B.a4E=A.a(s(["When you tap share on a hadith or another passage, the text is handed to the share sheet on your device. Whatever app you then choose, such as a message or a social app, receives that text under its own rules. Daily Islam does not see who you sent it to."]),t.s)
B.adg=new A.af("Sharing from the app",B.a4E)
B.a2Y=A.a(s(["If this policy changes, the updated text will be posted on this page and on the published copy, with a new date at the top. Continuing to use Daily Islam after that date means the new text is the one that applies.","The date on this page is 10 November 2026. Check the published copy if you want to confirm you are reading the latest version."]),t.s)
B.adG=new A.af("Changes to this policy",B.a2Y)
B.a2y=A.a(s(["Questions about this policy can be sent to Muhammad Khurram Jamil at khurram.jamilsatti@gmail.com. Please include enough detail to understand the request, such as whether you are writing about the website or the phone app."]),t.s)
B.acI=new A.af("Contact",B.a2y)
B.a2j=A.a(s([B.adI,B.adE,B.acK,B.acv,B.acL,B.adl,B.acC,B.adJ,B.acH,B.adw,B.adg,B.adG,B.acI]),t.BC)
B.aus=new A.Rq("Privacy policy",B.a2j,null)
B.a2J=A.a(s(["These terms cover the Daily Islam website and the Daily Islam phone apps. By reading, listening, or using a tool here, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please stop using the website and the apps.","Daily Islam is offered for personal worship, study, and daily practice. It is free to use. The phone apps are supported by ads. There is no account to create and no subscription to buy."]),t.s)
B.adh=new A.af("Using Daily Islam",B.a2J)
B.a4v=A.a(s(["You may read the Quran, hadith, books, and guides, and you may listen to the nasheeds, for your own learning and worship. You may share a passage from the share button for personal use.","You may not copy the app, the website, or the catalog and present it as your own product. You may not scrape the pages in bulk, resell the content, or interfere with the service so that other people cannot use it."]),t.s)
B.acV=new A.af("Personal use",B.a4v)
B.a4j=A.a(s(["Quran text in the app follows the Indo-Pak script. Translations include English and, where it is available, Urdu. Hadith is drawn from the six books: Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, Sunan Abi Dawud, Jami at-Tirmidhi, Sunan an-Nasa\u2019i, and Sunan Ibn Majah.","Some hadith still have no Urdu text in the app. Where that happens, the app says the Urdu translation is not available. That gap is a limit of the published source, not a hidden passage.","Seerah books open inside the reader when a file is available. A book that fails to load can be opened again later. Daily Islam does not promise that every title will remain online forever, because some files are hosted outside the app."]),t.s)
B.ad3=new A.af("Quran, hadith, and books",B.a4j)
B.a2u=A.a(s(["Prayer times are calculated on the device from your location and from the method and madhab you choose. They are a guide for the day. Local mosque announcements and moon-sighting decisions can differ by a few minutes or, for the calendar, by a day.","The Hijri date is calculated. Moon sighting can shift Ramadan and the two Eids by a day. Confirm the start and end of Ramadan, and the Eid days, with your local community."]),t.s)
B.ad2=new A.af("Prayer times and the Hijri date",B.a2u)
B.a27=A.a(s(["Nasheeds are streamed for listening inside Daily Islam. Arabic tracks are vocal. The Urdu list includes public recordings so the library can be large enough to browse. Tracks with a war theme are not included.","Playback depends on the network. A track that does not start can be tried again. Daily Islam does not promise that every recording will stay available, because the audio is served from outside hosts."]),t.s)
B.adj=new A.af("Nasheeds",B.a27)
B.a4f=A.a(s(["Scan Halal looks up a barcode and checks the listed ingredients. The result is a reading aid. It is not a fatwa, and it is not a certificate. Ingredients lists can be incomplete, out of date, or different from the package in your hand.","Check the package yourself, and ask a scholar when a product matters for your worship. A missing product, or a product with no ingredients, means the lookup could not decide. It does not mean the product is halal."]),t.s)
B.acz=new A.af("Halal scan",B.a4f)
B.a4x=A.a(s(["The qibla direction uses the phone\u2019s compass and location. Metal, cases, and indoor walls can pull the compass off. Calibrate the compass and confirm the direction before you rely on it.","Prayer reminders are local notifications on the phone. They fire only if you allow notifications and if the app is allowed to run them. The flashlight control uses the phone lamp for wudu or for finding a page. It is not available as a website feature."]),t.s)
B.acP=new A.af("Qibla, notifications, and the flashlight",B.a4x)
B.a2f=A.a(s(["The phone apps may show banner ads and full-screen ads. Ads are provided by Google. Daily Islam does not control every advertisement that appears, and an ad is not an endorsement of that product.","The website shows one Google AdSense ad in the home page and one at the top of a detail page. They stay in the page while you scroll. It does not run the phone app\u2019s ads or any other ad code. Sexual content, nudity, and betting are not part of the ads we want shown. Store buttons on the website open Google Play or the App Store in a new tab so you can get the phone app."]),t.s)
B.acE=new A.af("Ads",B.a2f)
B.a2r=A.a(s(["Notes, favorites, and reading progress stay on the device where you created them. Daily Islam does not keep a backup of them on a server. If you delete the app or clear its storage, those items are gone.","You are responsible for the notes you write. Do not store another person\u2019s private information in a note."]),t.s)
B.adu=new A.af("Your notes and favorites",B.a2r)
B.a1x=A.a(s(["Use Daily Islam for lawful personal study and worship. Do not attempt to break the app, probe it for other people\u2019s data, or overload the website. Do not use the share tools to spread content that twists a passage into an attack on a person or a group.","The reading content is religious text and translation. It is not legal, medical, or financial advice. Zakat figures from the calculator are a worksheet. Confirm a zakat decision with someone qualified when you need a ruling."]),t.s)
B.ad6=new A.af("Acceptable use",B.a1x)
B.a52=A.a(s(["Quran text, hadith files, the Hijri calendar, nasheed audio, maps, ads, and product lookups come partly from other providers. Their availability, accuracy, and privacy practices are their own. A failure at one of those hosts can leave a page empty until the host responds again.","Links to Google Play, the App Store, and social networks leave Daily Islam. Those sites have their own terms."]),t.s)
B.acY=new A.af("Outside services",B.a52)
B.a2z=A.a(s(["The website and the apps are provided as they are. Daily Islam works to keep the text careful and the tools usable, and it does not promise that every page will be free of error or that the service will never be interrupted.","To the extent the law allows, Daily Islam is not liable for a decision you make solely from a calculated prayer time, a Hijri date, a halal lookup, or a zakat estimate. Use them as aids, and confirm what your worship requires."]),t.s)
B.acJ=new A.af("Provided as it is",B.a2z)
B.a33=A.a(s(["These terms can be updated. The new text will replace this page, and the date at the top will change. The date on this page is 10 November 2026. Using Daily Islam after an update means you accept the terms as they then read."]),t.s)
B.acG=new A.af("Changes to these terms",B.a33)
B.a2V=A.a(s(["Questions about these terms can be sent to Muhammad Khurram Jamil at khurram.jamilsatti@gmail.com. Please say whether you are writing about the website or the phone app, and include the page or the feature you mean."]),t.s)
B.adr=new A.af("Contact",B.a2V)
B.a1_=A.a(s([B.adh,B.acV,B.ad3,B.ad2,B.adj,B.acz,B.acP,B.acE,B.adu,B.ad6,B.acY,B.acJ,B.acG,B.adr]),t.BC)
B.aut=new A.Rq("Terms and conditions",B.a1_,null)
