B.avP=new A.Gm("Laylat al-Qadr","The Prophet \ufdfa said to seek the Night of Decree in the odd nights of the last ten of Ramadan: the 21st, 23rd, 25th, 27th, and 29th. It is better than a thousand months (Quran 97:3).",null)
B.avQ=new A.Gm("How to break the fast","The sunnah is to break the fast at Maghrib with fresh dates, and if there are none, with dry dates, and if there are none, with water. Then the Maghrib prayer.",null)
B.avR=new A.Gm("Taraweeh","In Ramadan the night prayer is prayed after Isha. Scholars differ on praying eight or twenty rak'ahs. Both are practiced. Witr is prayed at the end.",null)
